   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Chef Viktor Barinov personally brings his latest culinary creation to the VIP table of restaurant owner Dmitry Nagiyev. Confident in his culinary genius, the chef boasts about the exquisite flavor while Dmitry prepares to judge the dish. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Дмитрий, сейчас ты попробуешь шедевр!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Виктор, ты снова хвалишь себя?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Это настоящее кулинарное произведение искусства!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
